::: {.cell-output-display}
![](index_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-1-1.png){fig-alt='Scatterplot of child height against parent height, showing a positive but noisy relationship.' width=960}
:::
:::


We want to explain this *noisy* relationship...

## Regression line


::: {.cell}
::: {.cell-output-display}
![](index_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){fig-alt='Scatterplot of child height against parent height with a fitted straight line through the positive pattern.' width=960}
:::
